      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is very useful for desktop users to have multiple objects in their inventory and switch with key press. Also, step-to-pick-up like in counter strike will need this.\n\nIf there is a reason for not exposing it in Udon API, at least you can share your concern with us.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
