  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-06-28T23:42:05.826Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC_Pickup.Drop exists, yet there is no way to force desktop users to automatically pick up an auto-hold enabled object.\nVR users currently wouldn't need this feature, as they can have pickups repeatedly moved to their tracking data hand position until they grip it.\nThis feature would be useful for automatic inventory systems (desktop keyboard number keys or Half Life Alyx style VR menus)",
